      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "原初之龙创造了三月女神与三轮月亮，并将她们升起至天上。在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9095,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "期间，尼伯龙根囚禁了月神们，并将月亮改造成了武器。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7625,
        "name": "三月女神",
        "desc": "<p>艾莉亚、桑娜妲与卡侬——是三位姐妹，也是曾经统治苍穹的月神。哥伦比娅·希珀塞莱尼娅是在三月女神陨落数千年后诞生的月神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/08/02/317661877/1f76253cb02cf46c0f6d8b836271b6f2_1336603059689273640.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "艾莉亚是恒月女神——三轮月亮中最大的月亮。正是因她庞大的月矩力，大海才有了潮汐。\n月髓\n蕴含着艾莉亚力量的「恒月」碎片。咏月使",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8396,
        "name": "菈乌玛",
        "desc": "被月光与森林祝福的圣女，一个诞生在「霜月之子」中的希望。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/08/b06e9ff48d57de4856f1a05b1199aae1_8565150401481594895.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "保留着「恒月」的月髓。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9339,
        "name": "桑娜妲",
        "desc": "<p>虹月女神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/19/326985891/60ceaba0c8911e94ed390a1c10e39c67_8120136957570239749.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9340,
        "name": "卡侬",
        "desc": "<p>霜月女神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/19/326985891/83ad656e45f97e90387a110a29206acf_5561017375535343569.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "艾莉亚是卡侬和桑娜妲的姐姐。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7476,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "新的月神。艾莉亚、桑娜妲、和卡侬将她们的权能赋予她，使她成为了「三月女神」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7106,
        "name": "愚人众",
        "desc": "<p>一个效忠于冰之女皇的至冬组织，其势力遍布整个大陆。该组织的执行官们正在追寻「神之心」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/21/326985891/38c409297992d7a782f0f1312f311707_6476532083466638871.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众正在研究「恒月」的遗骸。",
        "alignment": "center"
